  - recipe
---

Add @beef stock#2 cups to the kettle. Bring to a boil.

Add @bone marrow#1 lb and @black garlic#3 cloves. Simmer for ~30 minutes#.

Stir in @grave dust#1 pinch and @midnight thyme#1 sprig. Taste for memory.

Simmer for ~2 hours#. Serve with @sourdough#1 loaf, toasted.